<!-- ════════════════ 23 · CONFIG · SHARING ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Share via the repo" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #14b8a6;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/><line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"/><line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">23</span>Configuration</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Commit it, and the team <span class="accent">inherits it</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top: 24px;">

        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Commit to the repo (shared)</span>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Instructions</strong> &middot; <code>CLAUDE.md</code>, <code>.github/copilot-instructions.md</code>, <code>.cursor/rules</code>, <code>AGENTS.md</code></li>
            <li><strong>Skills</strong> &middot; <code>.claude/skills</code>, <code>.github/skills</code>, <code>.cursor/skills</code></li>
            <li><strong>Commands &amp; prompts</strong> &middot; <code>.claude/commands</code>, <code>.github/prompts</code>, <code>.cursor/commands</code></li>
            <li><strong>Hooks</strong> &middot; <code>settings.json</code>, <code>.github/hooks</code>, <code>.cursor/hooks.json</code></li>
            <li><strong>MCP servers</strong> &middot; <code>.mcp.json</code>, <code>.cursor/mcp.json</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Keep out of the repo (personal)</span>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Secrets and API keys</strong> &middot; use environment variables or a secret store</li>
            <li><strong>Personal preferences</strong> &middot; your own model and editor choices</li>
            <li><strong>Machine-specific paths</strong> &middot; anything tied to your setup</li>
            <li><strong>Local overrides</strong> &middot; <code>.claude/settings.local.json</code> (gitignored)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Commit these once and every teammate, and every new session, starts with the same setup. <strong>No re-explaining, no tokens spent re-stating conventions</strong>. A neutral <code>AGENTS.md</code> and the shared <code>.agents/skills</code> convention let one file serve more than one tool.
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "23" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "62" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
